║         SweatDrop Android - Quick Reference               ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

🚀 POKRETANJE
  pnpm android:setup   Setup environment (samo prvi put)
  pnpm android:run     Prvi put / kompletan setup
  pnpm android:dev     Svakodnevni development
  pnpm android         Direktno (bez provera)

🔧 PREDUSLOVI
  # Java 17+
  brew install openjdk@17
  export JAVA_HOME=$(/usr/libexec/java_home -v 17)
  
  # Android SDK
  export ANDROID_HOME=$HOME/Library/Android/sdk
  export PATH=$PATH:$ANDROID_HOME/platform-tools
  export PATH=$PATH:$ANDROID_HOME/emulator

🐛 DEBUGGING
  adb devices                          Prikaži uređaje
  adb logcat | grep ReactNative        Prikaži logove
  adb shell input keyevent 82          Otvori dev menu
  adb shell pm clear com.sweatdrop     Očisti app data

🔄 TROUBLESHOOTING
  npx expo start -c                    Očisti Metro cache
  ./clean-install.sh                   Očisti i reinstaliraj
  cd apps/mobile-app/android && ./gradlew clean

📚 DOKUMENTACIJA
  QUICKSTART.md        Brzi start guide
  ANDROID_SETUP.md     Detaljan setup
  SCRIPTS.md           Sve komande
  pnpm help            Prikaži sve komande

💡 TIPS
  - Kreiraj AVD u Android Studio (Tools > Device Manager)
  - Koristi android:dev za brzo pokretanje
  - Dodaj aliase u .zshrc za često korišćene komande
  - Proveri setup: java -version && echo $ANDROID_HOME

